# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Ignore large Playwright trace and artifact archives (>100MB hard limit on GitHub)
*.zip
**/*.zip
**/data/*.zip
**/trace.zip
**/.playwright-artifacts-*

# Ignore raw local test run directories
*-test-results/
Scenario 2/

# Video files (Combined videos total ~3GB. GitHub limits single pushes to 2GB and repos to 1GB)
# If you want to push videos to GitHub, consider using Git LFS (Large File Storage)
**/videos/*.webm
**/videos/*.mp4

# OS generated files
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
